    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Edit WC products on bulk with a well designed edition panel. Filter products using an advanced taxonomy selector. Include or exclude products from the filter results by entering IDs manually.</p>\n<p>Filter products: Select products to be edited using the available options in the filter section.<br />\nEdit products:<br />\n    1_ Add/Remove categories<br />\n    2_ Add/remove tags<br />\n    3_ Set new price<br />\n    4_ Modify current price<br />\n    5_ Set SALE price from absolute value<br />\n    6_ Set SALE price relative to regular price<br />\n    7_ Unset SALE price</p>\n<p>Get the premium plugin and get more advanced features:<br />\n    1_ Filter by product type<br />\n    2_ Filter by price<br />\n    3_ Filter by attributes<br />\n    4_ Stock manager<br />\n    5_ Schedule edits<br />\n    6_ Save edit templates.<br />\n    7_ Full editions history database</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>Download plugin and activate on your website, or use search bar on plugins dashboard screen to install.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<p>1.0.1: First release</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Lightweight, simple, yet effective and powerful plugin for bulk editing product prices and taxonomies.",
    "description": "<p>Edit WC products on bulk with a well designed edition panel. Filter products using an advanced taxonomy selector. Include or exclude products from the filter results by entering IDs manually.</p>\n<p>Filter products: Select products to be edited using the available options in the filter section.<br />\nEdit products:<br />\n    1_ Add/Remove categories<br />\n    2_ Add/remove tags<br />\n    3_ Set new price<br />\n    4_ Modify current price<br />\n    5_ Set SALE price from absolute value<br />\n    6_ Set SALE price relative to regular price<br />\n    7_ Unset SALE price</p>\n<p>Get the premium plugin and get more advanced features:<br />\n    1_ Filter by product type<br />\n    2_ Filter by price<br />\n    3_ Filter by attributes<br />\n    4_ Stock manager<br />\n    5_ Schedule edits<br />\n    6_ Save edit templates.<br />\n    7_ Full editions history database</p>\n",
